   reference with a name the core rulebook doesn't list are mapped onto the
   nearest core entry (a plain "bow" is the Longbow). The core *universal special
   rules* (Poisoned Attacks, Armour
   Piercing, Mighty Blow, Killing Blow, …) live verbatim in
   special-rules-common.js (window.COMMON_SPECIAL_RULES).
   ========================================================================== */
